; A block whose one fix names no coordinate system, and no *cs anywhere.
; cavern solves it on its own; under a *cs out (a georeferenced project)
; it fails with "The output projection is set but the input projection
; isn't" until the attachment names the system to read the fix in.
*begin bare
*fix A 500000 3000000 100
*data normal from to tape compass clino
A B 10 90 0
B C 10 0 0
*end bare
